<p><strong>Bottom line:</strong> Forget the brand distance charts. Put LED strips 4-6 inches away. Put T5 tubes 2-4 inches away. Put LED panels 12-18 inches away. Use the hand test. Adjust weekly. Your seedlings will tell you what they need. I wasted $60 and 3 batches learning this. Let my failure save you the trouble. <a href="https://www.amazon.com/s?k=LED+grow+light+for+seed+starting&tag=tabletopharve-20" target="_blank" rel="nofollow sponsored">Check current prices on Amazon</a>. Good LED strips start around $25. Cheap panels start at $15. Pick based on your shelf size, not the wattage number on the box.</p>

